  "description": "DICOMweb (PS3.18) server building blocks for ASP.NET Core on Plgic.Dicom: app.MapDicomWeb() maps QIDO-RS, WADO-RS (instances, metadata, frames, bulk data) and STOW-RS minimal-API endpoints over a pluggable IDicomWebStore, with streaming multipart, content negotiation and request size limits. Includes in-memory and file-system reference stores. Free for evaluation, non-commercial use and small companies (under USD 1M annual revenue); commercial production use by larger organisations needs a paid license. No license key required today.",
